  "headline_finding": "No candidate meets the FULL paper criterion. Real, candidate-specific DOP now exists for 4 of 7 candidates: SP_840980_0797630 (0.680), SP_832640_0090770 (0.841), SP_819860_1568660 (0.827), SP_830080_0535120 (0.630). All four FAIL the DOP<0.13 threshold by 4.8x-6.5x, despite these being the FOUR candidates with the strongest CPR>1 signatures of all 7 (7.2%-10.8% elevated pixels). The remaining 3 candidates (SP_842420_0421060, SP_809570_2454450, SP_817950_1586580) have negligible CPR>1 fractions (0.004%-0.14%) and were not pursued for DOP, since they already fail criterion 1 by a wide margin."
